# What AgentRun Server's image build sees (packages/serve/docker/Dockerfile): an allowlist. Everything is out but the
# workspace's manifests, its packages, the console the server serves, the build scripts and the two example files
# agentrun-pi's build reads.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!apps/console/
!scripts/
!examples/typed-research.ts
!examples/typed-research-fixtures.ts
# Out wherever they are, even inside the allowed folders: secrets, installed dependencies and build output.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
